<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">28042026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Only seven ships crossed the Strait of Hormuz on Monday, as Tehran offered to defer nuclear talks until the war and the shipping crisis were resolved.</s> <s>A US official said Trump rejected the proposal and cancelled envoy Jared Kushner's Pakistan-brokered channel, demanding nuclear terms upfront before any ceasefire.</s> <s>Germany's chancellor Friedrich Merz compared Washington's campaign to Iraq, and Iranian foreign minister Araghchi flew to Moscow, where Putin pleaded for mediation.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Israeli strikes killed fourteen people in southern Lebanese villages Sunday, including women and children — the deadliest single day since the November ceasefire.</s> <s>Brazil, whose nationals were among the dead, publicly condemned the attack, while Israel hasn't acknowledged the strikes or named a target.</s> <s>A truce that produces regular civilian casualties is no truce, and the families burying their dead this week know precisely what kind of peace they were sold.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Kunar and South Waziristan exchanged fire on Monday, as the March ceasefire between Pakistan and Afghanistan brokered by China visibly unravels.</s> <s>Islamabad denied hitting an Asadabad university, while Kabul called Pakistan's strikes worse than the previous round and accused it of breaking terms.</s> <s>The truce was always brittle — the Afghan Taliban won't evict the Pakistani Taliban from its sanctuaries, and Islamabad will not stop hitting back.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>About twenty-two percent of Gaza turned out on Monday for council elections, the first vote in Palestine since two thousand five.</s> <s>Nine UN tents served as polling stations in Deir al-Balah, where Fatah-linked slates won six of fifteen council seats amid the rubble.</s> <s>Israel still controls Gaza's crossings, water, and power — without international pressure, an elected council inherits authority over very little it can actually deliver.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>One hundred and twenty Mexican naval troops captured Audias Flores Silva, known as El Jardinero, inside a Nayarit cabin guarded by sixty armed personnel.</s> <s>Flores Silva ran Pacific drug routes for the Jalisco New Generation Cartel, one of three named successors since El Mencho died in February.</s> <s>The cartel's chain of command has been remarkably stable while rivals fracture, and a single capture rarely dismantles a vertical operation of this scale.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Kyrgyz president Sadyr Japarov has dismissed security chief Kamchybek Tashiyev over a letter demanding early elections that Tashiyev apparently backed.</s> <s>The two men co-governed Kyrgyzstan since the two thousand twenty revolution, with Tashiyev running the security apparatus and Japarov holding the presidency.</s> <s>Bishkek had been balancing China, Russia, and Turkey for half a decade — one-man consolidation will reshape that triangulation as Japarov faces re-election.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Damascus, Hamza al-Khatib's portrait faced his torturer in court this week.</s> <s>Atef Najib, cousin of the deposed president, ran the Daraa crackdown that triggered the two thousand eleven uprising — the first senior official tried on Syrian soil.</s> <s>Families from Daraa testified Monday, and the new government now faces prosecuting thousands of secret-police officers without collapsing what remains of the state.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South Africa's Social Development Minister Sisisi Tolashe structured a state aide's payslip so seven thousand rand a month transferred to her own daughter.</s> <s>The Ministerial Handbook bars such allowances for private homes, and East London is not a designated ministerial seat under the rules.</s> <s>It's a small-dollar story that exposes how a cabinet residence allowance has quietly become a private subsidy mechanism for the families who already hold power.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Russian bailiffs have opened sixty-two enforcement proceedings against Google, extracting around five hundred sixty-one million dollars from frozen domestic accounts.</s> <s>The debt has doubled since February, even though Google formally exited Russia in two thousand twenty-two and left only its dormant accounts within reach of domestic courts.</s> <s>Enforcement worked — and other authoritarian states are now studying the playbook for forcing concessions from a tech company that thought it had already left.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Canberra has tabled a two point two five percent levy on Meta, Google, and TikTok revenue unless each strikes voluntary payment deals with Australian publishers.</s> <s>The two thousand twenty-one News Media Bargaining Code gave platforms a negotiated exit, but the new bill taxes non-compliance by default.</s> <s>It's the first time a Western state has switched from negotiated rates to a default tax structure, and every small media market is likely to copy the template.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>OpenAI is now free to buy Amazon cloud, after a restructuring that kills Microsoft's revenue-share obligation and the so-called <sub alias="A G I">AGI</sub> clause that would have revoked Microsoft's license at superintelligence.</s> <s>OpenAI's fifty billion dollar Amazon Web Services arrangement, which Microsoft was weighing legal action over, can now proceed without contest.</s> <s>The decoupling reshapes the alliance that defined the last three years of AI infrastructure, and it loosens the single tightest knot in the industry.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Researchers in London have identified an enzyme called <sub alias="P M twenty D one">PM20D1</sub> that drives microglia to clear amyloid plaques in the brains of mice.</s> <s>The enzyme cleaves a lipid signal that activates microglia onto plaques — a target where direct antibody approaches have failed for more than a decade.</s> <s>The team confirmed the same mechanism in human Alzheimer's brain tissue, with clinical trials the unresolved next step, God willing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russia says Ukraine killed one plant worker in a drone strike at the occupied Zaporizhzhia nuclear site.</s> <s>The International Atomic Energy Agency confirmed the death and repeated that strikes near occupied nuclear sites must not occur under any circumstances.</s> <s>Ukraine's Energoatom counts fifteen blackouts at the plant since two thousand twenty-two, each raising a radiation risk that no party in this war now meaningfully controls.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Brussels says Google's Gemini exclusively holds Android access to hotwords, screen context, and hardware interfaces that rival AI assistants are denied.</s> <s>The EU's Digital Markets Act requires Google to share those system privileges with competitors, and the European Commission must rule by July twenty-seventh.</s> <s>Failure means fines of up to ten percent of global turnover — and a template for breaking AI assistant lock-in well beyond European borders.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Arizona State University has launched a platform that chops faculty lectures into atomic AI modules without notifying or compensating the professors who recorded them.</s> <s>The university claims work-for-hire ownership of course recordings, and faculty have no opt-out right under their existing contracts.</s> <s>It extends the two thousand twenty-four Hollywood writers' fight over training data into the academy — pedagogy itself is now institutional intellectual property.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>